e symbol was incorrectly hidden).\n\nThe crash occurs reliably when opening any project in the editor.\n\nCrash log:\n\n```\ngodot.macos.editor.arm64 malloc: *** error for object 0x3426c090080: pointer being freed was not allocated\ngodot.macos.editor.arm64 malloc: *** set a breakpoint in malloc_error_break to debug\n\nhandle_crash: Program crashed with signal 5\n\n[1] libsystem_platform.dylib    0x0000000180abb744 _sigtramp + 56\n[2] libsystem_c.dylib           0x00000001809b6900 __abort + 164\n[3] libsystem_c.dylib           0x00000001809b685c __abort + 0\n[4] libsystem_malloc.dylib      0x00000001808b5224 malloc_vreport + 892\n[5] libsystem_malloc.dylib      0x00000001808b8f78 malloc_report + 64\n[6] libsystem_malloc.dylib      0x00000001808bde04 ___BUG_IN_CLIENT_OF_LIBMALLOC_POINTER_BEING_FREED_WAS_NOT_ALLOCATED + 76\n[7] libsystem_pthread.dylib     0x0000000180aaf620 _pthread_tsd_cleanup + 488\n[8] libsystem_pthread.dylib     0x0000000180ab22e8 _pthread_exit + 84\n[9] libsystem_pthread.dylib     0x0000000180ab1c14 _pthread_start + 148\n[10] libsystem_pthread.dylib    0x0000000180aacba8 thread_start + 8\n\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nBuild the macOS editor from master (includes commit 55abbc4244)\nLaunch the editor\nOpen any project\nEditor crashes with signal 5 (SIGTRAP)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https: